th the Left Party amid a dispute over Israel policy and antisemitism. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nuremberg airport briefly closed after in-flight emergency</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9ce42e2d0b23be7fa1c206262237248fffcf9bd8c092f669b5bb6e0ae3f7fb73</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T13:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nuremberg-airport-briefly-closed-after-in-flight-emergency/a-79649580--a029343e2cff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nuremberg-airport-briefly-closed-after-in-flight-emergency/a-79649580?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Police are investigating a suspected in-flight emergency on a Corfu flight. After the airport reopened, the airline said they believed the emergency code was a result of a technical malfunction.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's far-right AfD forges a pro-Russia alliance with the BSW</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9ef17a2041a953c57596cc674af4656cb51671a6535fe0aa3946ec1df1d8bcb5</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:16:41Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T15:13:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-far-right-afd-forges-a-pro-russia-alliance-with-the-bsw/a-79662413--9f342390b0ef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-far-right-afd-forges-a-pro-russia-alliance-with-the-bsw/a-79662413?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">In Saxony-Anhalt, the AfD and BSW are joining forces to push for negotiations with Moscow. What is driving this rapprochement?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Nord Stream: Germany puts suspected Ukrainian pipeline saboteur on trial</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d8d20a189bfedd61c7b6610c3ae4988a7de0722165f46403e27a82a3f9e7bdb5</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T11:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617--ad974b48960d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-germany-puts-suspected-ukrainian-pipeline-saboteur-on-trial/a-79647617?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Ukrainian citizen faces court in Hamburg, accused of attacking the Nord Stream gas pipelines in 2022. It raises questions about Kyiv's possible role in the explosions. German support for Ukraine is also under scrutiny.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Do non-German nationals commit more crimes than Germans?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2b64b4aa7d78f4469459578ecd8745dd6622b90c4d8b2494175df4bb169e8bdd</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T08:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/do-non-german-nationals-commit-more-crimes-than-germans/a-79657273--07f237eb177a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/do-non-german-nationals-commit-more-crimes-than-germans/a-79657273?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">People without German passports appear more frequently in German police crime statistics than German nationals. A new study explains why.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's China calculation shifts as import pressures eclipse export benefits</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf1cfc6e415451f9978b493d524e7f43e521d0113373e4bedef106297a276bc2</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T08:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-china-calculation-shifts-as-import-pressures-eclipse-export-benefits/a-79571852--c4df7eb8a062.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-china-calculation-shifts-as-import-pressures-eclipse-export-benefits/a-79571852?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany has long resisted tougher action against China, fearing retaliation. But rising pressure on key industries has pushed Berlin to seek stronger EU trade-defense powers to protect its industrial base.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>'Ragebait' is the 2026 German Youth Word of the Year</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:224f082c59f6fe29f2c649ce513f9dada024dbce3912240b212e6fcb1bca78ac</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-10T13:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158--c39c4c350c71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ragebait-is-the-2026-german-youth-word-of-the-year/a-79608158?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Already named the 2025 Oxford Word of the Year, "rage bait" has also been widely adopted in German slang.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Author or artificial intelligence? Literature in crisis</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2982cfff49673da22c8690a6a13a8e5e149cbe8c5135dcf1fab0e65936f303c</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-10-09T15:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/author-or-artificial-intelligence-literature-in-crisis/a-79618610--2ddbca94bc5e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/author-or-artificial-intelligence-literature-in-crisis/a-79618610?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">AI is a hot topic at this year's Frankfurt Book Fair. An international literary scandal has raised questions about machine-generated texts.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Servers at Munich's iconic Oktoberfest call for more respect</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9eb74ecf285f2b33fdc418ead1d33e89c82615450c63b0536f03f141569f9248</id><updated>2026-10-14T20:15:31Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T1